# Media files are intentionally omitted from source deployment.
*.mp4
*.mp4.*
*.mov
*.mov.*
*.m4v
*.m4v.*
*.webm
*.webm.*
*.mp3
*.mp3.*
*.wav
*.wav.*
*.m4a
*.m4a.*
*.flac
*.flac.*
*.ogg
*.ogg.*
*.png
*.png.*
